          323f235e6fe39860 t("Motion says where something went, and is quick enough that nothing waits on it. It's a little more expressive in the right places, each taken case by case.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(0,30) s(fill,hug:45) ext(888,) f[(a396b711b03a02d9,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Purpose"
