            6bf0335710251ccd t("A panel's width or a row's place takes PANEL, what comes and goes in place FADE, and a scroll that passes rows SCROLL, which is longer since it goes further. Two that take the same time today keep their own names, so they can change apart.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(0,26.5) s(fill,hug:45) ext(888,) f[(4e08c7839ef90a2d,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Purpose"
